# Core layer (`src/core`)

## Allowed

- **`domain/`**: Pure logic, no imports from `app/`, `src/adapters/`, `next/*`, `react`, `@prisma/client`, or HTTP/SDK clients.
- **`ports/`**: Interfaces only (types + `interface`/function signatures). No implementations, no Prisma.
- **`application/`**: Use cases orchestrating ports + domain. Inject deps via parameters or small factories; **no direct Prisma or framework globals**.

## Forbidden

- Importing `src/adapters/**` or `app/**` into `src/core/**`.
- Side-effectful singletons inside domain (clock/random OK via injected interfaces when testing matters).

## Patterns

- New external capability → add a **port** in `src/core/ports/`, implement in `src/adapters/`, wire in `src/adapters/composition.ts` (or equivalent).
